                                                "sense_id": "0cb7303c-7c23-33a2-9180-1539c9fa2646",
                                                "text": "a price-label gun"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d982e7b-0664-4b68-ad54-4364eb8bc807",
                                                "sense_id": "0cb7303c-7c23-33a2-9180-1539c9fa2646",
                                                "text": "The piercing gun cannot be disinfected and therefore there is a risk of transmitting hepatitis and other infections."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "651a9e1b-dfab-3b3b-b61b-ec4c32e34ee5",
                                        "entry_id": "94fc6e91-d5f5-3bf6-b08b-2665fd33ac7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A long surfboard designed for surfing big waves (not the same as a longboard, a gun has a pointed nose and is generally a little narrower)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd7711ca-990f-44f7-a16e-177215ec05c4",
                                                "sense_id": "651a9e1b-dfab-3b3b-b61b-ec4c32e34ee5",
                                                "text": "2000, Drew Kampion, surfline.com\nby the winter of 1962, the Brewer Surfboards Hawaii gun was the most in-demand big-wave equipment on the North Shore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "64f90389-86ac-3b4b-a5ea-bdfcb2b71fe9",
                                        "entry_id": "94fc6e91-d5f5-3bf6-b08b-2665fd33ac7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A pattern that \\\"fires\\\" out other patterns."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a3ab72a0-f598-41e0-b18e-7be34efff4ba",
                                                "sense_id": "64f90389-86ac-3b4b-a5ea-bdfcb2b71fe9",
                                                "text": "The glider gun on the bottom of the NOT circuit emits a continuous stream of gliders, while the data stream source emits a glider only when there is a value of 1 in the stream[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b576f9d1-0365-41d7-bd2d-a684e03e396e",
                                                "sense_id": "64f90389-86ac-3b4b-a5ea-bdfcb2b71fe9",
                                                "text": "It would be especially interesting if someone can find an \"airplane gun\", which generates airplanes at regular intervals."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e804b3dd-f598-4bc6-b89a-a698453a8995",
                                                "sense_id": "64f90389-86ac-3b4b-a5ea-bdfcb2b71fe9",
                                                "text": "Greene's period-416 2c/5 spaceship gun"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "29b3f5c3-0a8d-38d6-bd86-4b0bea70d4a6",
                                        "entry_id": "94fc6e91-d5f5-3bf6-b08b-2665fd33ac7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who carries or uses a gun (rifle, shotgun or handgun), particuarly with reference to how quickly the person can draw and fire the gun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "metonymically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86fde95b-a668-4bac-824c-8c4c1aa8b5fa",
                                                "sense_id": "29b3f5c3-0a8d-38d6-bd86-4b0bea70d4a6",
                                                "text": "Some said that the cowboy was the fastest gun in the West."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d2909e1-4b6e-4bf2-8c84-f3ca85eb96f4",
                                                "sense_id": "29b3f5c3-0a8d-38d6-bd86-4b0bea70d4a6",
                                                "text": "[…] we had one lawman - Sheriff Dirty Herwick, \"the slowest gun in the West.\" Dirty was a kindly man, a java addict whose knees knocked at the sight of blood. Back then, we winched our own car wrecks out of ravines and chased away mountain lions with kitchen brooms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74e4968e-6142-4342-891c-9e2d174facfd",
                                                "sense_id": "29b3f5c3-0a8d-38d6-bd86-4b0bea70d4a6",
                                                "text": "\"I must say, I quite enjoy having the best detective in the business, and the fastest gun in the West, on my payroll.\" \"First of all,\" Clint said tightly, \"I'm not the fastest gun in the West, and second, I'm not on your payroll.\" Royce held up both of his hands. \"I didn't mean to offend you, sir[…]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c7380d6-da53-4eec-95bf-fe2c6b0f88a8",
                                                "sense_id": "29b3f5c3-0a8d-38d6-bd86-4b0bea70d4a6",
                                                "text": "\"They say he's the fastest gun in the whole goddamn world.\" \"I thought Blackie was supposed to be the best,\" Harlow remarked. “That's what all you chaps keep tellin' me.\" \"Blackie is the fastest gun in the Oklahoma Territory,\"[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "249bac9e-9df8-460e-8c53-72049459c549",
                                                "sense_id": "29b3f5c3-0a8d-38d6-bd86-4b0bea70d4a6",
                                                "text": "They want to take on the fastest gun in town."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a65387e-4234-47d0-b463-71805f19de46",
                                                "sense_id": "29b3f5c3-0a8d-38d6-bd86-4b0bea70d4a6",
                                                "text": "\"He's a fast gun out of Arizona.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1e6b793-32f6-392c-9f35-8528bce52445",
                                        "entry_id": "94fc6e91-d5f5-3bf6-b08b-2665fd33ac7b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An electron gun."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17cdeb42-5f5f-4fd0-8c2f-2840d20a1905",
                                                "sense_id": "a1e6b793-32f6-392c-9f35-8528bce52445",
                                                "text": "The problem is figuring out how to get the electrons from the red gun to hit only the red phosphors, the electrons from the blue gun to hit only the blue phosphors, and so on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "225bf7c5-9ef1-383f-81ac-7baee750c38a",
                                        "entry_id": "94fc6e91-d5f5-3bf6-b08b-2665fd33ac7b",
